# Build output — compiled DLLs + Playwright browser binaries (~1.4 GB across bin/),
# plus generated .g.cs / .AssemblyInfo.cs under obj/ that otherwise pollute code searches.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Local dev secrets — never pull these into context (.env.example stays, it's the template).
.env
.env.local

# OS / editor cruft
**/.DS_Store
